<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>可以看到，<strong>这部分代码和具体的CPU架构是深度绑定的，换了架构就必须全部重写</strong>。因此，跨CPU架构的移植工作门槛是比较高的，通常都是由RTOS内核开发者去完成的。</p>
<h2 id="芯片板级支持包-每次换芯片都要改" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#芯片板级支持包-每次换芯片都要改"><span>芯片板级支持包：每次换芯片都要改</span></a></h2>
<p><strong>最下一层是和具体芯片型号相关的板级支持包，当移植到不同型号的MCU时都要重新适配。</strong></p>
<p>在我的课程源码里，这一层包括：bsp目录下的led、beep、button这些外设驱动，Startup目录下的启动文件，中断向量表，系统时钟配置等等。</p>
<p>比如在RISC-V的CH32V203上，系统节拍的配置是由下面的代码完成的：</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">SysTick</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">-></span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">CTLR </span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 0</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">SysTick</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">-></span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">CMP </span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> SystemCoreClock </span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">/</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> (</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">1000</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> /</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> OS_SYSTICK_MS</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">SysTick</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">-></span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">CTLR </span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> 0x</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">F</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>而到了STM32F4上，就可以用CMSIS的标准接口：</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665">SysTick_Config</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">SystemCoreClock </span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">/</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 1000</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">);</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>由于不同MCU的外设特性、寄存器定义都不一样，这部分相关的代码必须重写。</p>
<h2 id="综上所述" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#综上所述"><span>综上所述</span></a></h2>
<p>综上所述，<strong>当将RTOS从一个架构移植到另一个架构时，需要将CPU架构移植层和芯片板级支持包重写，而RTOS核心层是无需改动的</strong>。这种分层设计的好处，就是把和硬件相关的东西进行了隔离，这样一来，当将RTOS切换到其他平台时，只需要做相对有限的工作。</p>
<p>绝大多数情况下，作为RTOS的使用者，我们都是利用官方提供的BSP模板，针对具体的芯片做一些适配，不需要自己去做跨CPU架构的移植工作。</p>
